Design: We’ll augment the existing pipeline by adding a StandardScaler and performing a grid search over the regularization strength C in logistic regression to find the best hyperparameter setting. Specifically, we wrap scaling and logistic regression in an sklearn Pipeline, search Cs=[0.01,0.1,1,10] via 5-fold CV optimizing AUROC, then report the best CV score. Finally we retrain the pipeline on all data with the optimal C and save it for inference via the unchanged predict() function.
