Design: I propose to integrate a PCA dimensionality reduction step into the feature pipeline to remove noise and redundant information before classification. Specifically, after scaling the ResNet50-extracted features, we apply PCA to retain 95% of variance, then fit a class-weighted logistic regression, tuning C over the same grid. This should reduce overfitting and boost cross-validated AUROC. We then retrain on full data and output predictions on any test image folder.
